<view class="about-page">
  <view class="brand-panel">
    <view class="brand-code">EMC</view>
    <view class="brand-copy">
      <text class="eyebrow">LABORATORY SERVICE</text>
      <text class="app-name">EMC 智造实验室</text>
      <text class="app-description">实验室设备预约与使用管理工具</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-label">隐私与服务</view>
  <view class="info-group">
    <view class="info-row privacy-row" hover-class="row-hover" bindtap="openPrivacyContract">
      <view class="row-icon"><app-icon name="user-shield" size="32" label="隐私保护指引" /></view>
      <view class="row-content">
        <text class="row-title">隐私保护指引</text>
        <text class="row-description">查看个人信息收集与使用说明</text>
      </view>
      <app-icon name="arrow-right" size="32" color="#89918e" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <text class="privacy-note">隐私保护指引由微信提供展示，内容以小程序后台已发布版本为准。</text>

  <view class="section-label version-label">版本信息</view>
  <view class="info-group version-group">
    <view class="version-row">
      <text class="version-name">当前版本</text>
      <text class="version-value">V{{version}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="version-row">
      <text class="version-name">运行环境</text>
      <text class="environment-tag">{{environment}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="page-footer">
    <text>为实验室设备高效、有序使用提供支持</text>
    <text class="copyright">EMC LAB · V{{version}}</text>
  </view>
</view>
